WEBVTT

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.393
What is that?

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.148
Mommy, what's she carrying?

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.201
CORPSE DEALER

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:35.410
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.787
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
How's this, Mr. Jyubei?

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.456
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.290
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
Ten mon.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.209
Only ten mon?!
But it's a whole head!

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.503
And I'm saying it's not worth much.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.088
Excuse me,

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:47.464
SETSUNA          TOWA

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.924
do you know anything
about the Dream Butterfly?

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:53.928
No, I don't. Why do you ask?

00:00:54.346 --> 00:00:59.225
Setsuna here had her dreams stolen from it.
I want to get them back for her.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.935
Even though I said I don't care.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:04.147
Dream Butterfly, huh?
I'll keep my ears open.

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:05.732
Thank you very much.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:09.819
Hey, Mr. Jyubei.
Don't you have anything juicier?

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:13.698
If it's you Half-Demon Princesses,
then I may have just the thing.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.033
What is it?

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:19.954
There's been a lot of travelers going missing
in the northern mountains.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.460
Now<i> that </i>sounds promising!
Leave it to us three, then.

00:03:08.229 --> 00:03:10.023
"The Cat Juan at the Old Temple"

00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:27.457
Hey, Moroha!

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:29.376
Huh, what?

00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:32.796
You're in my way, so get off and
use those legs you're so proud of!

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:38.009
What am in the way of when
I'm so graciously being the lookout?

00:03:38.009 --> 00:03:41.304
How the hell could you say
I'm in the way, huh?

00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:44.349
Get your annoying butt
out of my face!

00:03:44.349 --> 00:03:48.353
You think it's annoying?
What's so annoying about it?

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:49.479
Watch out!

00:03:57.987 --> 00:03:59.823
Oh, no!

00:04:11.668 --> 00:04:13.670
Wow, look at her go.

00:04:13.878 --> 00:04:15.505
Can you blame her?

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:19.259
She said her parents ignored her
to take care of the cats.

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:21.177
That's called neglect, you know.

00:04:21.302 --> 00:04:24.848
If you're hungry, you should just
steal whatever's around!

00:04:24.848 --> 00:04:29.310
Hey, do you know about people going missing
near an old temple in a mountain pass?

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:30.228
Huh?

00:04:30.228 --> 00:04:32.397
No one comes from the mountain pass.

00:04:32.397 --> 00:04:35.108
And whoever goes there
doesn't come back.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:37.527
We're here because
we've been asked to look into it.

00:04:37.986 --> 00:04:41.239
I dunno, but my village is at
the foot of a mountain pass.

00:04:41.823 --> 00:04:44.284
Let's check it out,
since it's on the way.

00:04:46.578 --> 00:04:48.288
So this is the village.

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:49.622
Yeah!

00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:53.710
Look at all these cats.

00:04:54.252 --> 00:04:58.089
The Feudal Era has cat villages,
just like cat islands, huh?

00:04:58.381 --> 00:05:02.218
But for some reason,
everyone in the village...

00:05:03.053 --> 00:05:04.679
Wh-What the...

00:05:05.013 --> 00:05:07.640
The cats are really being doted on.

00:05:08.558 --> 00:05:09.684
Momma!

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.187
– There, there.
– Momma, I'm home.

00:05:13.563 --> 00:05:16.399
– All right, it's time to eat.
– Momma...

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:18.818
What a horrible mother.

00:05:19.861 --> 00:05:21.988
Just like I thought.

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:28.912
Aw, kitties are so cute.

00:05:28.912 --> 00:05:30.080
Cute?

00:05:30.455 --> 00:05:32.040
There, there...

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.417
You idiot.

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:39.464
What did you do that for?!

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:44.052
I'm telling you, that's no cat.
Is your nose just a bump on your face?

00:05:44.052 --> 00:05:45.303
Look more closely.

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:48.223
The entire village smells like demons.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.142
The smell of demons?

00:05:58.024 --> 00:06:00.235
I guess that's that, then.

00:06:04.948 --> 00:06:06.366
Do not think ill of us.

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:11.663
I'll turn you all into lunch
for my Kurikaramaru!

00:06:18.086 --> 00:06:20.380
How about I get you all at once!

00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:22.465
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:06:31.349 --> 00:06:34.019
I still feel a bit sorry for them.

00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:36.021
You're still saying that?

00:06:36.021 --> 00:06:37.272
Momma!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.482
Momma, please wake up.

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:41.568
Momma!

00:06:42.819 --> 00:06:44.112
Huh?

00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:47.490
Oh, welcome back.
Where've you been?

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.492
Momma, I'm so glad.

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:54.831
I see. So the villagers were
being controlled by the ghost cats.

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:58.168
I didn't notice.

00:06:59.002 --> 00:07:00.670
The smell of demons...

00:07:01.171 --> 00:07:03.131
Your sense of smell is too dull, Towa.

00:07:04.382 --> 00:07:06.801
I've never smelled something
like this before.

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:12.015
That "Tokyo" place you lived in
seemed to be pretty demon-free.

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:15.685
But you won't live long if you
don't get used to this soon.

00:07:16.019 --> 00:07:17.479
I know.

00:07:19.064 --> 00:07:20.065
Lady Moroha.

00:07:20.065 --> 00:07:21.900
Grandpa Myoga. You were here?

00:07:22.233 --> 00:07:24.944
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
This Myoga would follow you

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:25.737
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
to the ends of the Earth.

00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:26.696
to the ends of the Earth.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.239
Liar.

00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.825
The ghost cats ran towards the mountain.

00:07:32.911 --> 00:07:37.040
So the missing travelers near
the old temple is their work, huh?

00:07:37.582 --> 00:07:39.209
Seems like an easy win.

00:07:39.209 --> 00:07:42.504
Ghost cats tend to get stronger
as the years go by,

00:07:42.504 --> 00:07:45.465
but it looks like there
weren't any that strong.

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:48.009
Time to hunt for corrupted cats.
Let's go!

00:07:48.009 --> 00:07:48.968
All right.

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:49.928
Miss.

00:07:50.762 --> 00:07:51.805
What is it?

00:07:51.888 --> 00:07:53.682
Um, well...

00:07:54.808 --> 00:07:56.851
Thank you, Miss!

00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:00.355
You're very welcome.

00:08:00.939 --> 00:08:02.774
Okay, see you!

00:08:03.942 --> 00:08:06.945
Good bye!

00:08:10.782 --> 00:08:13.785
Just like its name,
it sure is an old temple.

00:08:13.785 --> 00:08:16.079
I smell something suspicious.

00:08:16.579 --> 00:08:20.500
But I don't sense anything,
so they're probably hiding somewhere.

00:08:20.667 --> 00:08:23.086
Do you have business at this temple?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.964
Oh, it's just a monk.

00:08:26.256 --> 00:08:27.257
Julian!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.259
Julian?

00:08:29.384 --> 00:08:32.012
MONK LIVING IN OLD TEMPLE – JUAN
My name is Juan.

00:08:32.262 --> 00:08:35.932
He looks exactly like
Mei's favorite idol, Julian!

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:37.475
Eye...doll?

00:08:37.475 --> 00:08:40.729
I think she's talking about
weird modern stuff again.

00:08:40.729 --> 00:08:42.480
Ugh, geez.

00:08:43.064 --> 00:08:45.108
They really do look alike.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:49.154
If this were the modern era,
he'd definitely be a celebrity!

00:08:50.989 --> 00:08:54.117
Could he be Julian's ancestor?

00:08:54.117 --> 00:08:54.993
Beg pardon?

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.163
Just forget about
the modern world for a bit.

00:08:58.163 --> 00:09:01.583
Hey, Mr. Monk, have you seen
any ghost cats around here?

00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:02.917
Beg pardon?

00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:05.003
I see.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:10.091
Ghost cats in this mountain...
I can't say I've ever seen any.

00:09:10.425 --> 00:09:12.469
Any strange occurrences recently?

00:09:12.594 --> 00:09:13.720
Such as?

00:09:13.803 --> 00:09:17.974
A lot of people who have passed
through here have gone missing.

00:09:18.308 --> 00:09:23.313
There have been people who'd stay
the night here, but nothing special to note.

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:29.736
Would you three like to
stay the night here as well?

00:09:29.736 --> 00:09:32.614
The mountain pass can be
quite dangerous at night.

00:09:33.365 --> 00:09:35.867
Yeah, we'll take you up on your offer.

00:09:35.867 --> 00:09:36.951
Yep.

00:09:39.329 --> 00:09:41.539
Make yourselves at home, then.

00:09:44.042 --> 00:09:47.337
I wonder if the ghost cats
are hiding in the mountain?

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:49.214
They're here.

00:09:49.381 --> 00:09:51.007
What? Here?

00:09:51.007 --> 00:09:53.218
The entire temple smells of demons.

00:09:53.468 --> 00:09:55.345
Then Julian, too?

00:09:55.553 --> 00:09:59.683
No, that monk smells like a human.

00:10:00.058 --> 00:10:03.353
Towa, you need to hurry up
and learn to sniff out demons.

00:10:03.853 --> 00:10:05.897
And stop calling him Julian.

00:10:08.108 --> 00:10:09.234
What's this?

00:10:09.234 --> 00:10:11.069
It's one of Julian's songs.

00:10:12.487 --> 00:10:14.614
Not my thing.

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:23.373
So what should we do
with the ghost cats?

00:10:23.998 --> 00:10:27.836
If we leave ourselves open,
wouldn't they come to us?

00:10:27.836 --> 00:10:29.671
The basics of a demon slayer.

00:10:29.671 --> 00:10:31.047
Demon slayers, huh.

00:10:31.423 --> 00:10:35.760
I guess I do have to get used to it,
or I won't be able to help people.

00:10:35.969 --> 00:10:37.095
Helping people?

00:10:37.178 --> 00:10:38.138
Isn't that right?

00:10:38.138 --> 00:10:39.848
Demon slaying is a job.

00:10:39.848 --> 00:10:42.350
But even in that village back there...

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.479
But for now,
it's nothing but small ghost cats.

00:10:46.479 --> 00:10:48.773
Is this really gonna get us money?

00:10:49.858 --> 00:10:52.736
Moroha, why are you
trying to save up so much?

00:10:53.778 --> 00:10:56.281
It doesn't look like you're spending it.

00:10:56.489 --> 00:10:59.576
All right, time to pretend
like I'm sleeping.

00:10:59.576 --> 00:11:00.702
Hey.

00:11:00.827 --> 00:11:02.078
Come on, you guys, too.

00:11:02.912 --> 00:11:05.498
I guess we should make our beds, too.

00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:07.417
I can't fall asleep anyway.

00:11:07.417 --> 00:11:08.668
Right.

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:25.310
Towa, your energy is leaking out.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.145
What? Sorry.

00:11:28.688 --> 00:11:31.941
Although it really doesn't matter
at this point.

00:11:36.237 --> 00:11:39.157
You fell right into our trap,
you ghost cats!

00:11:40.867 --> 00:11:42.202
Take this!

00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:46.289
Towa, behind you!

00:11:54.506 --> 00:11:56.508
I knew they'd come out.

00:11:58.885 --> 00:12:00.011
What's going on?

00:12:01.304 --> 00:12:02.180
Why, this is...

00:12:02.597 --> 00:12:05.684
Hey Mr. Monk,
you didn't notice all these ghost cats?

00:12:06.518 --> 00:12:07.519
I didn't.

00:12:07.852 --> 00:12:11.940
Why are these ghost cats
living in this old temple?

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:15.235
Well, I most likely failed to
notice the phenomenon

00:12:15.235 --> 00:12:18.279
because I lack sufficient training.
However...

00:12:18.947 --> 00:12:23.243
The truth is,
this temple has an old legend.

00:12:24.202 --> 00:12:29.624
About one hundred years ago,
a powerful priest sealed a demon

00:12:29.624 --> 00:12:33.378
and laid its corpse to rest
beneath the floors of this temple.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.548
Under the floors?

00:12:36.548 --> 00:12:39.467
Your move, Towa.
You want to help people, right?

00:12:39.592 --> 00:12:41.928
Yeah. Let's go investigate.

00:12:44.014 --> 00:12:46.391
Are you sure it's really here?

00:12:46.474 --> 00:12:48.560
It sure is dark down here.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:50.311
We need some light.

00:12:50.687 --> 00:12:52.022
Hang on one second.

00:12:52.939 --> 00:12:54.190
Here you go.

00:12:54.315 --> 00:12:56.234
Awesome! That's perfect.

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:57.902
What're you doing?!

00:12:57.986 --> 00:12:59.779
Cut it out!

00:12:59.904 --> 00:13:00.905
Geez.

00:13:03.283 --> 00:13:05.201
But man, this thing is great!

00:13:09.539 --> 00:13:11.583
I've put up a barrier.

00:13:11.583 --> 00:13:14.544
This should prevent demons
from entering.

00:13:15.003 --> 00:13:17.714
Don't worry Juan, I'll protect you.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.425
Thank you very much.

00:13:20.759 --> 00:13:22.802
That is very reassuring.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.638
Towa, that cheat!

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:30.894
"Let's go investigate," she says.
But we're the ones doing the dirty work!

00:13:32.062 --> 00:13:33.438
Hey, there's a hole.

00:13:38.026 --> 00:13:39.778
The bones of a ghost cat?

00:13:40.236 --> 00:13:42.697
Looks like the legend was true.

00:13:42.989 --> 00:13:44.699
But this one is...

00:13:53.875 --> 00:13:55.210
What's going on?

00:13:55.293 --> 00:13:56.461
This is...

00:13:56.628 --> 00:13:57.837
Damn it.

00:13:58.922 --> 00:14:01.007
DEMON CAT – GIANT GHOST CAT
Hit it all at once, Setsuna!

00:14:01.508 --> 00:14:03.760
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:14:09.099 --> 00:14:10.892
Cyclone Burst!

00:14:13.853 --> 00:14:15.772
All right! We got—huh?

00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:16.898
What?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.483
It's coming back together.

00:14:18.483 --> 00:14:22.570
Something's wrong.
These bones don't smell like the ghost cats.

00:14:23.655 --> 00:14:25.490
Setsuna, Moroha!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.617
Do you think they're okay?

00:14:28.118 --> 00:14:30.912
If it's those two,
I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:14:31.454 --> 00:14:33.289
We've had a few in the past as well.

00:14:33.415 --> 00:14:37.836
They'd come to slay the cats here,
but ended up being eaten.

00:14:38.169 --> 00:14:40.130
What a lot of fools they were.

00:14:42.298 --> 00:14:44.801
You three will share their fate.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.095
Your face...

00:14:47.804 --> 00:14:49.931
How about this!

00:14:54.853 --> 00:14:56.312
Human bones.

00:14:56.688 --> 00:14:59.858
These are probably the bones
of the people it's eaten.

00:14:59.858 --> 00:15:02.819
The one controlling these bones
is somewhere nearby.

00:15:02.819 --> 00:15:06.031
The only other person here
is that monk guy.

00:15:08.408 --> 00:15:11.828
You're about to be eaten,
so might as well give up!

00:15:12.454 --> 00:15:14.998
So you're the big boss of the ghost cats?

00:15:17.667 --> 00:15:20.628
I did say that I put up a barrier.

00:15:22.589 --> 00:15:26.217
Not with the monk's Buddhist magic,
but with my demon magic.

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.428
Setsuna, Moroha!

00:15:30.263 --> 00:15:34.351
Right now, they're fighting
with ghost cats that I control.

00:15:34.351 --> 00:15:37.729
Not one of you
will leave this temple alive.

00:15:38.188 --> 00:15:40.648
Then we just have to take you down.

00:15:40.857 --> 00:15:42.442
Don't make me laugh.

00:15:42.442 --> 00:15:47.614
I am over three hundred years old!
You little girls think you can defeat me?

00:15:47.614 --> 00:15:48.448
Get her!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:54.913
No matter how many—

00:15:54.913 --> 00:15:56.039
<i>Help me...</i>

00:15:57.457 --> 00:15:59.000
Please help me.

00:15:59.542 --> 00:16:01.711
You're not a demon?

00:16:02.128 --> 00:16:03.380
I am...

00:16:05.215 --> 00:16:08.718
Why does it matter?
You're about to get eaten.

00:16:14.516 --> 00:16:15.767
Again?

00:16:17.394 --> 00:16:19.688
I cut and I cut,
but nothing's working!

00:16:19.688 --> 00:16:21.231
Moroha, I'm leaving this to you.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.108
Hey, where are you—

00:16:25.568 --> 00:16:26.444
Towa!

00:16:27.112 --> 00:16:29.489
A barrier? Is it the apparition's spell?

00:16:29.489 --> 00:16:31.032
Move, Setsuna.

00:16:31.574 --> 00:16:34.577
I'll break through the barrier
with my Sacred Arrow.

00:16:38.081 --> 00:16:39.958
What?! My barrier!

00:16:40.542 --> 00:16:41.668
Setsuna.

00:16:42.252 --> 00:16:45.880
You smelled only of human
until now. So why...

00:16:47.382 --> 00:16:51.928
I had been sealed beneath the floors
of this temple for a hundred years.

00:16:51.928 --> 00:16:57.892
But recently, this foolish monk
thought to hold a service for me.

00:16:58.268 --> 00:17:04.399
The sutra he chanted out of compassion
was able to awaken my soul.

00:17:04.858 --> 00:17:10.280
I broke through the seal
and took control of the monk's body.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.490
But he tried to save you!

00:17:13.908 --> 00:17:16.119
I was not seeking salvation!

00:17:16.661 --> 00:17:19.622
I've heard enough. Brace yourself.

00:17:19.622 --> 00:17:20.999
Wait, Setsuna.

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:24.085
Juan was taken over by the ghost cat.

00:17:25.795 --> 00:17:30.967
This monk is my disguise after all,
so I've been letting him live.

00:17:30.967 --> 00:17:33.845
So what will you do?
Will you cut down the monk as well?

00:17:37.307 --> 00:17:38.141
What?

00:17:38.767 --> 00:17:40.018
A cat's paw!

00:17:42.145 --> 00:17:43.438
So that's the main body.

00:17:43.938 --> 00:17:48.318
There's a smell leaking from your belly
that wasn't there when you were human.

00:17:48.818 --> 00:17:51.488
And what of it?

00:17:54.699 --> 00:17:55.950
Oh, no.

00:17:57.827 --> 00:18:01.498
Go ahead and split me in two
along with the monk!

00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:08.129
Hey, that's dangerous!
I'm fighting all by myself here!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.801
If that's how you feel,
then I won't hold back.

00:18:12.801 --> 00:18:14.678
You can't. Please don't, Setsuna.

00:18:14.678 --> 00:18:15.929
Why do you stop me?

00:18:15.929 --> 00:18:17.889
Because that's Juan, that's why!

00:18:18.264 --> 00:18:19.849
We can't slay him otherwise!

00:18:19.849 --> 00:18:20.892
Setsuna!

00:18:21.184 --> 00:18:23.228
Why don't you try it then, Towa?

00:18:23.311 --> 00:18:26.815
See if you can cut the ghost cat
without getting the monk.

00:18:27.065 --> 00:18:27.982
But...

00:18:27.982 --> 00:18:29.317
Towa, just do it!

00:18:31.361 --> 00:18:34.322
Otherwise, you're gonna have
to cut all of him down!

00:18:35.198 --> 00:18:39.119
Speaking of whether one can or can't,
Master Inuyasha was able to do it.

00:18:39.119 --> 00:18:42.038
What are you talking about
at a time like this?!

00:18:42.205 --> 00:18:48.044
Master Inuyasha's Tessaiga was able to take
just the opponent's demon power.

00:18:48.044 --> 00:18:51.339
Tessaiga? Why talk about
something we don't have?

00:18:52.674 --> 00:18:56.052
None of us can steal away
just the demon power.

00:18:56.511 --> 00:18:59.723
Steal away just the demon power?
So that's it.

00:19:01.391 --> 00:19:02.600
That one time...

00:19:03.852 --> 00:19:06.229
I won't let you cut me down so easily.

00:19:06.688 --> 00:19:08.064
We have no choice.

00:19:08.064 --> 00:19:10.400
No, Setsuna. Don't kill Juan.

00:19:10.692 --> 00:19:12.360
If we don't, then we'll get killed!

00:19:13.528 --> 00:19:16.197
How long will you be dragging
that era with you?

00:19:16.197 --> 00:19:18.324
Your life is at stake in this era.

00:19:18.324 --> 00:19:20.285
Cut those ideals down
with the ghost cat!

00:19:20.368 --> 00:19:21.244
I can't!

00:19:21.411 --> 00:19:22.454
What?

00:19:22.954 --> 00:19:25.874
Setsuna, you saw a bit of
what it's like there!

00:19:26.374 --> 00:19:30.003
That peaceful world...
and everyone in it!

00:19:34.507 --> 00:19:38.678
When I get back your dreams,
I'm going back over there,

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.889
because I promised Mei that.

00:19:42.349 --> 00:19:45.393
And that's why I'll risk my life,

00:19:46.186 --> 00:19:48.355
but I won't take
other peoples' lives away!

00:19:49.272 --> 00:19:50.607
Laughable!

00:19:52.442 --> 00:19:53.068
Towa!

00:19:56.488 --> 00:19:59.324
Juan, I'll save you now!

00:20:11.002 --> 00:20:12.754
The demon energy is
being absorbed?

00:20:22.806 --> 00:20:25.141
No matter where I cut,
it keeps coming back.

00:20:25.433 --> 00:20:26.393
What?

00:20:27.811 --> 00:20:31.564
It looks like Lady Towa
is taking the demon's power.

00:20:37.028 --> 00:20:39.489
Did Towa cut that monk down, too?

00:20:45.495 --> 00:20:48.873
As expected from
the daughter of Lord Sesshomaru.

00:20:48.998 --> 00:20:52.877
Hah! Then I think she could do
with more cold-heartedness!

00:20:55.839 --> 00:21:01.011
You were lucky this time, but next time
your naiveté might cost you your life.

00:21:01.428 --> 00:21:07.017
Don't worry. Like I said before,
until I get back your dreams, I won't die.

00:21:09.728 --> 00:21:11.021
– Ouch.
– Juan.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.648
What have I...

00:21:14.107 --> 00:21:17.277
I'm so glad. I'm really glad.

00:21:24.034 --> 00:21:26.161
Please rest in peace.

00:21:29.372 --> 00:21:33.418
This disaster was all because of
my pride and inexperience.

00:21:33.877 --> 00:21:36.296
I'm not powerful enough to be a priest.

00:21:36.463 --> 00:21:39.090
I shall return to the secular life.

00:21:39.466 --> 00:21:42.719
Please become the
proud ancestor for Julian.

00:21:43.219 --> 00:21:44.512
Beg pardon?

00:21:44.721 --> 00:21:46.890
You're spouting nonsense again.

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:48.933
I mean, it's fine.

00:21:49.476 --> 00:21:52.228
At least we took care of the job!

00:21:52.604 --> 00:21:54.439
CORPSE DEALER

00:21:54.439 --> 00:21:55.607
CORPSE DEALER
What did you just say?!

00:21:55.899 --> 00:21:56.941
Fifteen Mon.

00:21:57.233 --> 00:21:58.360
But, why?

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:01.363
He wasn't that big of a deal, was he?

00:22:01.488 --> 00:22:04.366
It was a real pain trying not to
split him in two!

00:22:04.908 --> 00:22:06.910
Sounds like a you problem.

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:12.874
Then give us jobs that'll
actually make us money!

00:23:42.922 --> 00:23:45.008
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:45.008 --> 00:23:50.305
I go out to search for the Dream Butterfly,
but I get lost and run into someone strange.

00:23:50.305 --> 00:23:52.265
My name is Riku.

00:23:52.349 --> 00:23:54.684
Just remember me as Riku the pirate.

00:23:54.851 --> 00:23:59.356
But the katana he leaves behind
gets me pinned as a robber.

00:23:59.356 --> 00:24:04.986
And at the estate I'm taken to, the underlings of
one of the Four Perils are waiting for me!

00:24:05.403 --> 00:24:08.406
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"Meeting through an Apple"

00:24:08.740 --> 00:24:23.894
Were you pleased, my dear princess?
